      <name>"Frida" Apples Purée Brix 11</name>
      <category>Fruit</category>
      <info>A purée made from the Swedish apple "Frida", with a measured Brix of 11.
Confidence: high
The product is a single-ingredient apple purée (Frida variety) with Brix 11, indicating 11% soluble solids, mostly sugars. Typical apple purée has ~0.3g protein, ~0.1g fat, ~1.5g fiber, and ~0.2g ash per 100g. Sugars are mostly fructose, glucose, and sucrose in a ~5:2.5:2 ratio. No added sugars or sugar alcohols. Minerals and vitamins estimated from standard apple purée values. All values adjusted for Brix 11 (slightly diluted compared to standard apple purée).</info>
